{{Quote|text="Oh my, aren't you a cutie! Welcome to the valley, dear. It's so exciting when someone new moves in! Have you met my son, Victor?"}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Villagers|villager]] who lives at [[Jenkins' Residence]] with her son [[Victor]], just east of the General Store and north of 1 River Road in Pelican Town. She is one of the 7 marriage candidates added by Stardew Valley Expanded.

Olivia wants the best for her son, but she doesn't understand that what he wants and what she thinks is best are not always the same things. Their personalities can be too similar in some ways, and they clash when both of their moods are negative. While they have both traveled the world together, Olivia doesn't quite get why Victor would rather have his nose in a book than experience the world around him. Their taste in mushrooms is also opposite.

Most of the time Olivia spends with other villagers in town is with Jodi and Caroline. Olivia enjoys their idle gossip time and swapping stories of their similar-age children, Sam and Abigail. Olivia also speaks highly of [[Sophia]]'s wine-crafting ability and [[Susan]]'s crop quality. However, she looks down her nose at [[Andy]], not understanding his rural lifestyle compared to the cosmopolitan way of life her money and time in Zuzu City have brought her.

