{{HeartsTableRowDesc|1 = Loss of Composure|2 = The Farmer walks in on Olivia questioning Victor about why he hasn't gotten a job yet. Victor says that he's trying to get one but that there aren't many jobs this far from the city. Olivia asks if he'll move back to Zuzu City, but Victor insists he wants to stay in Stardew Valley. Olivia tells him he needs to try harder, and Victor says he's going to step outside to get some air. Olivia apologizes to the Farmer and admits that she lost her composure. She says Victor is very bright, and she doesn't understand why he hasn't found a job yet. She worries he's gotten too comfortable living at home. She then says she has business to attend to, but that the Farmer is welcome to stay and browse the library.<sup>(+25 friendship)</sup>}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

