{{HeartsTableRowDesc|1 = Gossip Gals|2 = Olivia, Jodi, and Caroline are chatting in the town square about parenthood. When the Farmer shows up, they talk about how their farm was on the radio and about how much good the farm is doing for their community. Olivia gossips about how much money Sophia makes at her vineyard and says the Farmer should get into wine-making. Caroline says that Pierre is very happy with the quality produce he gets from the shipments from your farm. They then gossip about how they wish Susan would sell her produce in town instead of shipping it all out of the valley, and how Andy’s produce gets shipped to low-income communities. Caroline mentions that Pierre and Andy had an argument recently because Pierre would only sell Andy’s produce if it was labelled as “Grown at Fairhaven Farm”. Olivia says the conversation has turned sour, and that they will go back to talking about parenthood. They bid the Farmer farewell.<sup>(+25 friendship)</sup>}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

