==Quotes==
<!---Keep to a list of 5 quotes for general section and 2-3 for events--->
Here is a selection of {{PAGENAME}}'s dialogue lines.
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">Regular <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Regular}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Introduction|quote= "Oh my, aren't you a cutie! Welcome to the valley, dear. It's so exciting when someone new moves in! Have you met my son, Victor?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Spring, Tuesday, with 2 hearts|quote= "I've been practicing yoga for years. I can do advanced poses such as 'Lord of the Dance' and 'Lotus'. Staying healthy is important if you want a beautiful, flawless body like mine."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Spring, Friday, with 6 hearts|quote= "I always indulge myself with a nice glass of wine on Fridays. Gus carries some rare vintages, and is always stocked with wine from Blue Moon Vineyard."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Spring 9|quote= "Sometimes I miss how busy I used to be back in Zuzu City at my corporate job. I have so much free time here in the valley. It allows me to focus on my hobbies, but sometimes I can get lost in my thoughts..."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Summer, Friday, with 6 hearts|quote= "Yoga is a great activity if you have high blood pressure or high cholesterol. I think Andy could use some yoga. Or at least a healthier diet. I know I've spoken harshly of him before, but I worry about him. Ready-made Joja meals aren't a healthy choice."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Summer, Sunday, with 4 hearts|quote= "Jodi told me Vincent isn't doing well in math. She has so much to worry about... I may ask Victor if he can tutor him. If not, I suppose I do have a knack for math from trading..."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Summer 10th|quote= "The governor doesn't visit Stardew Valley often. It's an honor he's visiting us tomorrow. I expect you'll be on your best behavior and contribute to the soup." }}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Fall, Wednesday, with 4 hearts|quote= "Pierre makes spiced cider during fall. He doesn't sell it at the front counter. He only sells it to his closest friends. Luckily, Caroline and I have an excellent relationship. Next time, I'll pick a little extra up for you."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Fall, Saturday, with 0 hearts|quote= "Marlon walked into the saloon with the wizard last night and they both went to the back room. A person wearing a brown cloak joined them, but their face was covered. I wonder what on earth was going on back there..."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Fall 22|quote= "Despite the fact I was an accounting manager at Joja, I never shop at their stores, and never will. Their products aren't healthy, and they'd damage my complexion."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Winter, Wednesday, with 8 hearts|quote= "Winter in Pelican Town is beautiful. All of the colorful decorations alongside the bright white snow makes every day feel so festive. Gus, Pierre, and Mayor Lewis do a wonderful and tasteful job with their decorating. This is such a wonderful place to make a home, isn't it, [Farmer]? I'm glad you settled here too."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Winter, Sunday, with 4 hearts|quote= "Sometimes I worry that during my time at Joja, I did more harm to the world than good. Over time, Joja has been pushing unhealthy foods, making decisions that are damaging the environment...it's irresponsible. That's part of the reason I left. I'm glad the path my life took led to us becoming friends."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Winter 13|quote= "I broke one of my Gotoran dishes this morning. Now I need to spend 6,000g to replace it. They're getting even harder to find. It's important that we treasure the things that remind us of where we come from, don't you think?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= After marrying [[Victor]]|quote= "I always knew my son would find his special someone in life. I'm happy that it's you, [Farmer]. My doors are always open to family. Don't be a stranger!"}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">Events <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Events}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Egg Festival|Egg Festival]]|quote= "My, my. What a beautiful day for a festival. Are you participating in the egg hunt, [Farmer]?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Flower Dance|Flower Dance]]|quote= "Gatherings such as this give me a great opportunity to talk to Caroline and Jodi."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Luau|Luau]]|quote= "The governor has honored us with his presence, [Farmer]! I may try speaking with him after Mayor Lewis has finished his conversation. Perhaps he enjoys vintage wine?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Dance of the Moonlight Jellies|Dance of the Moonlight Jellies]]|quote= "The sky is clear tonight. A flawless backdrop of moonlight for the jellies, wouldn't you say [Farmer]?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Stardew Valley Fair|Stardew Valley Fair]]|quote= "Are you enjoying the fair, sweetie?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Spirit's Eve|Spirit's Eve]]|quote= "I heard screams coming from the maze. What could possibly be in there!?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Festival of Ice|Festival of Ice]]|quote= "Brr... I should have worn an extra layer. Are you participating in the fishing competition?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Feast of the Winter Star|Feast of the Winter Star]]|quote= "Merry Winter Star, dear! Isn't it wonderful how happy everyone is on a day such as this?"}}
